msgid ""
"Python 'boto3' library for AWS services. Available methods: 'client', "
"'resource', 'Session'<br/>Supports AWS services like EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, "
"CloudWatch, etc.<br/>Please check the <a href='https://boto3.amazonaws.com/"
"v1/documentation/api/latest/index.html' target='_blank'>Boto3 Documentation</"
"a> for the detailed information about the services and methods."
msgstr ""
"Libreria Python 'boto3' per servizi AWS. Metodi disponibili: 'client', "
"'resource', 'Session'<br/>Supporta i servizi AWS come EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, "
"CloudWatch, ecc.<br/>Verificare la <a href='https://boto3.amazonaws.com/v1/"
"documentation/api/latest/index.html' target='_blank'>documentazione Boto3</"
"a> per informazioni dettagliate sui servizi e i metodi."

